                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game pays homage to things like Heretic or Quake.\n- You are a very efficient gunslinger and a heretic vs cultists. You're Caleb from Blood.\n- Atmosphere is killer.\n- Metal tunes.. just go check trailer, I won't spoil.\n- The movement by default is correct: Run by default, but Shift for slow move. Gem\n- Climb to the rooftops.. anywhere you see should be able to get - gets you there, usually.\n- Theres nice minor shoot-correction to keep things cinematic. Not an issue at all.\n- And you getting shoty within 4 minutes of game, getting dual pistol within 6.\n- I wouldn't have expected something live up to Blood level of fluency. This does.\n- First metal tune kicks in in about 30 min in.",
